Z||000002||skitime||07-12-2001||12:16 PM||||Welcome to the forum! Write this down. It is the email address of someone you will need.  Chris Pond is at pondski@aol.com and he can get you most everything you need for your car.  Good service and very fair prices. Tell him skitime sent you. I used him throughout my restoration in fact I got a inner fender well liner from him too. I can see in the picture below several parts I got from him. Fender liner, nose emblem, door gasket, trim, clearance light, disc brake backing plates, inside mirror and those are the visible ones.  I probably gotten 30-40 different items from him and never been dissapointed.  (Front fender and door skin from Fleabitdog - Thanks) <P> BTW, He is from southern CA in the Los Angeles area (Meaning rust free parts)<P>To post pictures download the Pennocks Image Poster from the bottom of the page and follow the instructions. <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P7080039-3.JPG">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 07-12-2001).]||||reg||1
